  'The whole interface in 30 languages, switched live in Preferences.': "整個介面支援 30 種語言，可在偏好設定中即時切換。", 'The Manual': "手冊", 'A searchable manual inside the app. Press F1.': "App 內可搜尋的手冊。按 F1。",
