  "Your tablet is arriving as a mouse. In your tablet driver, turn on Windows Ink, restart the driver, then reopen FormMorpheus.": "你的數位板被辨識為滑鼠。請在數位板驅動程式中開啟 Windows Ink，重新啟動驅動程式，然後重新開啟 FormMorpheus。",
  "This pen reports no pressure. In your tablet driver, turn on Windows Ink, restart the driver, then reopen FormMorpheus.": "此筆未回報壓力。請在數位板驅動程式中開啟 Windows Ink，重新啟動驅動程式，然後重新開啟 FormMorpheus。",
  "Your tablet is arriving as a mouse. Install your tablet's own driver (the system's generic one gives no pressure), then reopen FormMorpheus.": "你的數位板被辨識為滑鼠。請安裝數位板專屬的驅動程式（系統通用驅動程式不提供壓力），然後重新開啟 FormMorpheus。",
  "This pen reports no pressure. Install your tablet's own driver (the system's generic one gives no pressure), then reopen FormMorpheus.": "此筆未回報壓力。請安裝數位板專屬的驅動程式（系統通用驅動程式不提供壓力），然後重新開啟 FormMorpheus。",
  "Your tablet is arriving as a mouse. On Linux the web view may not pass pressure through; an X11 session with your tablet's driver gives the best chance.": "你的數位板被辨識為滑鼠。在 Linux 上網頁檢視可能無法傳遞壓力；使用數位板驅動程式的 X11 工作階段成功機會最大。",
  "This pen reports no pressure. On Linux the web view may not pass pressure through; an X11 session with your tablet's driver gives the best chance.": "此筆未回報壓力。在 Linux 上網頁檢視可能無法傳遞壓力；使用數位板驅動程式的 X11 工作階段成功機會最大。",
  "Pen detected: pressure {min} to {max}, tilt, twist.": "偵測到筆：壓力 {min} 至 {max}，傾斜，旋轉。", "Pen detected: pressure {min} to {max}, tilt.": "偵測到筆：壓力 {min} 至 {max}，傾斜。",
