  "Forward {n}x": "快轉 {n}x", "Back {n}x": "倒轉 {n}x", "Pressure drives": "壓力控制", "Turn the pen about its own axis. On a pen that reports no twist this has no effect.": "繞筆身軸線轉動筆。對不回報旋轉的筆無效。",
