  "Depth sets how far the camera moves the selected track: 0 stays still, 1 moves normally, above 1 moves farther (a near layer).": "深度決定鏡頭移動所選軌道的幅度：0 不動，1 正常移動，大於 1 移動更遠（近景圖層）。",
  "Following {name}": "正在跟隨 {name}", "Following nothing": "未跟隨任何對象", "The text changed length after it was keyed with Warp or Distort, so its edges may crop. Check the keys.": "文字在用扭曲或變形設定關鍵影格後長度改變，邊緣可能被裁切。請檢查關鍵影格。",
