  "No beats were found in this sound.": "此聲音中找不到節拍。", "Add Markers on Beats": "在節拍上新增標記", "Beat": "節拍", "Ruler Drag Scales Time": "拖曳尺規縮放時間", "Snap to Seconds": "貼齊到秒",
