  "The start and the end of a taper take the same length while this is on.": "開啟時，漸細的起點和終點長度相同。", "Turns every stamp by a random angle, up to a full turn. It does not move the stamps: Position scatter does.": "將每個印章隨機旋轉，最多一整圈。它不會移動印章：移動印章的是位置散佈。",
