  "Improved": "改良", "How the stamp picture is sampled when it is drawn: None keeps hard pixels, Classic is smooth, Improved is smoothest.": "繪製時印章影像的取樣方式：無保留硬像素，經典較平滑，改良最平滑。", "Rotation follows stroke": "旋轉跟隨筆畫",
  "A moving grain turns with the direction of the stroke: 100 follows it, -100 turns against it.": "移動的顆粒隨筆畫方向轉動：100 跟隨，-100 反向。", "Burnt edges mode": "燒邊模式", "How the darkened edge blends with the stroke.": "變暗的邊緣如何與筆畫混合。",
  "Stamp pixels at least this strong become solid and the rest clear: a hard edge with no soft fade.": "強度不低於此值的印章像素變為實心，其餘變為透明：邊緣生硬，沒有柔和漸隱。", "The pen must lean past this angle before tilt changes the stamp.": "筆必須傾斜超過此角度，傾斜才會改變印章。",
  "Size compression": "大小壓縮", "A leaning pen lays the stamp at its own size side by side, so the texture of the tip does not stretch.": "傾斜的筆會依印章本身大小並排放置，因此筆尖紋理不會被拉伸。", "The brush list and the exported thumbnail show one stamp of the brush instead of a stroke.": "筆刷清單和匯出的縮圖顯示筆刷的一個印章，而不是一條筆畫。",
