  "Press and hold still on the picture to open the color loupe. Touch: fingers only. All: pen and mouse too.": "在圖片上按住不動可開啟取色放大鏡。觸控：僅手指。全部：筆和滑鼠也可。", "Hide Eyedropper and Fill buttons": "隱藏滴管和填色按鈕", "Pen and input": "筆與輸入",
