  "The Theater, your wall of movies, covers the stage while no movie is open. What's New lists the recent additions and opens once after an update when the third choice is on.": "影院是你的影片牆，在沒有開啟影片時覆蓋舞台。新功能會列出最近的新增內容，並在選取第三項時於更新後開啟一次。",
  "Gallery shows your movies as a wall of posters with their names. Library adds a standing sidebar, filter and sort, and each movie's kind and age.": "圖庫以海報牆的形式顯示你的影片及名稱。資料庫增加固定側邊欄、篩選和排序，以及每部影片的類型和時間。",
  "A movie is in the Theater from the moment you make it, and every step you take is written to it within a moment. There is nothing to save. This interval is a safety net: it writes the open movie again if a write was ever missed.": "影片從建立起就在影院中，你的每一步操作都會在片刻內寫入。無需儲存。此間隔是一道保險：若有寫入遺漏，會重新寫入已開啟的影片。",
