  "A second place for your movies: a folder your own sync service keeps in step. Copy to Cloud in the Theater sends a copy of a movie there; your library stays where it is.": "影片的第二個存放處：由你自己的同步服務保持同步的資料夾。影院中的「複製到雲端」會把影片副本傳送到那裡；你的資料庫保持原位。",
  "Keyboard layout": "鍵盤配置", "Keycaps show the letters of this layout. A shortcut belongs to a physical key, so it does not move when the layout changes.": "鍵帽顯示此配置的字母。快速鍵屬於實體按鍵，因此配置改變時不會移動。", "Play the preview": "播放預覽", "Animate this color": "為此顏色設定動畫",
