  "More effects": "更多效果", "Ripple, Halftone, Outline, Gradient Map, Glitch, Kaleidoscope, Hue Range Shift and more, each with its own switch.": "波紋、半色調、輪廓、漸層對應、故障、萬花筒、色相範圍偏移等，每個都有獨立開關。",
  "Titles": "標題", "Presets, gradient fill, glow, text on a path and animators over a range of letters, words or lines.": "預設、漸層填色、光暈、路徑文字，以及作用於一段字母、詞語或行的動畫器。",
  "Shake, follow and parallax depth per track, and a count-in before a Perform take.": "每條軌道的晃動、跟隨與視差深度，以及演出拍攝前的倒數。", "Watercolor and oil": "水彩與油畫",
  "Watercolor pools, darkens at its rim and bleeds while wet; oil frays at the ends and widens with tilt.": "水彩會積聚、邊緣變深，濕時會暈開；油畫筆觸兩端散開，傾斜時變寬。",
